{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>And the children of Israel shall lean.</b> These are the firstborn of Israel, for the Levites were given as atonement in their stead, and each firstborn leans upon his own one (Levite)." "<b>And the children of Israel shall lean their hands upon the Levites.</b> After the pattern of וסמכת את ידך עליו — Moshe with respect to Yehoshua. And every leaning that is done upon a person is an investiture of authority, and from this they learned to make officers (פרשין), as he explained in the pericope of ויחי regarding וישת ידו."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:16:57.392336957Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}